@startuml UC-28
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-28.md
title UC-28: Update Quantity
footer Feature CART-03 | Business rules: BR-19, BR-20
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Guest / Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "CartController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "CartService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Change quantity of a line
MVC -> API : PUT /api/cart/items/{id} { quantity }
API -> SVC : UpdateQuantityAsync(cartOwner, id, quantity)
SVC -> DB : Find line WHERE Id = id AND owned by cartOwner
alt line not found
  SVC --> API : NotFound
  API --> MVC : 404 Not Found
  MVC --> U : Reload cart
else quantity < 1
  SVC --> API : BadRequest
  API --> MVC : 400 Bad Request
  MVC --> U : Show "Use Remove to delete the item" (UC-29)
else quantity > StockQuantity (BR-20)
  SVC --> API : Conflict (available stock)
  API --> MVC : 409 Conflict
  MVC --> U : Show "Only N left in stock"
else valid
  SVC -> DB : Update Quantity\nSaveChangesAsync
  SVC --> API : CartDto
  API --> MVC : 200 OK
  MVC --> U : Show updated line and totals
end

@enduml
